    </section>

    <section xml:id='tests-OPERATOR-CHAINS'>
      <title>Operator Chains</title>
      <para>When the context holds a value, operators combine with operands according to standard mathematical precedence.
        Multiplicative operators (*, /, %, div, mod) bind tighter than additive operators (+, -).
        Comparison and equality operators have lower precedence than arithmetic.
        Operators of equal precedence associate left-to-right.</para>
