twice(dbl, 20)</programlisting></entry>
              <entry><literal>80

    </literal></entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </informaltable>
    </section>

    <section xml:id='tests-LAMBDA-CLOSURES'>
      <title>Closures</title>
      <para>A capturing lambda assigned to a delegate type is a true closure
        value carrying the captured variables. (Closures returned from a
        function escape onto the caller's region -- see the escaping-closure AOT
        regression test.)</para>
